{
  "000": {
    "text": "这段家庭视频放进硬盘，只占几百兆。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.58,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 512,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "1b3c89480496e6cd4400c30429a906ceaa75a0ed8be3ac8eccd5abbfbf58c3b2",
    "seconds": 3.12,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/public/audio/raw/000.wav"
  },
  "001": {
    "text": "如果把硬盘换成一滴 DNA，打开时还要一字不差，第一关不是容量，而是读写能不能撑住。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.58,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 512,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "10fd809e8618f10381bb2d209cedfcb163ba6db561eb73be3618876beb8be245",
    "seconds": 7.6,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/public/audio/raw/001.wav"
  },
  "002": {
    "text": "先故意试一次：把 0 和 1 直接换成 A、T、C、G四个字母，读回来却出现了缺字和重复。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.58,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 512,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "387d9fdb8f3410f29de65aad19c606c80666c68f14679008ff2d9d63dc496863",
    "seconds": 7.92,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/public/audio/raw/002.wav"
  },
  "003": {
    "text": "DNA 只有四个字母，二进制可以按两位映射成碱基。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.58,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 512,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "9001603e9279971420f44d63637e0afb9001fa3d205a6aae08469c0880ad7001",
    "seconds": 4.72,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/public/audio/raw/003.wav"
  },
  "004": {
    "text": "但连续一串 A，合成和测序都容易出错；G、C 太偏，整条链也不稳定。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.58,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 512,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "274fd7ef6d589315af1cff617c1ed4372e79af216877c76d111cf73ee3a7ae35",
    "seconds": 6.640041666666667,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/public/audio/raw/004.wav"
  },
  "005": {
    "text": "所以算法先把文件切成小片，每片带一个地址，像书架上的索引卡。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.58,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 512,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "811269bcd5ec0da8b5b553f2cebf0740b04ae6b43c42dd856ec5738646835374",
    "seconds": 5.76,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/public/audio/raw/005.wav"
  },
  "006": {
    "text": "地址让读回的短片段知道自己属于哪里，后面才有可能拼回原文件。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.58,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 512,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "f8863c547fbb2c1d606d12083565c25e404754b5d0d51f5de7b9dc1acf9151a6",
    "seconds": 5.84,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/public/audio/raw/006.wav"
  },
  "007": {
    "text": "接着检查每一条候选序列：G、C 比例落在可控区间，同一个字母不能连太长。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.58,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 512,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "82aba6f69259e00cd5c994914e941f4a5ae3ec244bad0077ab88bf5fa2ca9d5e",
    "seconds": 7.76,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/public/audio/raw/007.wav"
  },
  "008": {
    "text": "不合格的序列直接退回重新映射，不让它进入合成池。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.58,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 512,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "f16277e6518ab4833d1437e170ce889f4b68cdd91feaed04f277587d7739673b",
    "seconds": 4.88,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/public/audio/raw/008.wav"
  },
  "009": {
    "text": "这一步看起来像挑字母，其实是在给分子读写设备留出余量。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.58,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 512,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "3e72d11714fbaea1e2cd7b0f49941fe0521d8179b34634d5779f0fb89b7aba51",
    "seconds": 5.44,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/public/audio/raw/009.wav"
  },
  "010": {
    "text": "可只挑好序列还不够，因为保存和测序都可能丢片。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.58,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 512,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "174c1a1ac4bff169068e8755704cd9dfe30afc5442f6690a62e5fb11bbf262ff",
    "seconds": 4.4,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/public/audio/raw/010.wav"
  },
  "011": {
    "text": "DNA Fountain算法 把源片段随机组合成许多小液滴，每个液滴记住自己由哪些片段异或而成。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.58,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 512,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "e0c84e69589ac7ccfca11a71910b4137745aa7a2e29f9cb1817d8f5b3eb72b37",
    "seconds": 8.4,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/public/audio/raw/011.wav"
  },
  "012": {
    "text": "收到的液滴足够多时，解码器就像解数独一样，先找出只有一个未知数的那一格。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.58,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 512,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "bd1f2ed1f4f31581277956dd12a9424111b2a3e81927ee25fc33637c2a6c1af3",
    "seconds": 6.72,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/public/audio/raw/012.wav"
  },
  "013": {
    "text": "找回一片，就能继续消掉别的液滴里的未知数，缺掉几片也不至于全盘崩掉。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.58,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 512,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "0b1693319e1c1e9cacb2bc247c27f448d24dfab22b948cdbdc64378189a9a589",
    "seconds": 6.32,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/public/audio/raw/013.wav"
  },
  "014": {
    "text": "冗余不是把文件简单复制几遍，而是把恢复关系设计进每一滴里。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.58,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 512,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "4d04fc524e41eb14b77e58d1a5e9b0e8b0e9370384219880f1087abfbbfa8eac",
    "seconds": 5.28,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/public/audio/raw/014.wav"
  },
  "015": {
    "text": "这就是 Fountain 的关键：多一些不同的组合，换来更高的恢复概率。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.58,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 512,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "8630a5e55246c474db79e36c264aae09d5b0a319409bed4afad944605c1b0969",
    "seconds": 4.8,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/public/audio/raw/015.wav"
  },
  "016": {
    "text": "真正的链路还要经过合成、保存和测序。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.58,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 512,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "edbeb54204dd604a47a0b54e065c2a21d29c065218491751d5d60d1be91bdb3c",
    "seconds": 3.44,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/public/audio/raw/016.wav"
  },
  "017": {
    "text": "读回来的不是整齐原文，会混进替换、插入、缺失，也可能有片段根本没被读到。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.58,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 512,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "a2248ca27c3a993c1a42514b8d27a0775f9abfce88d04484b032638b1185f41c",
    "seconds": 6.88,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/public/audio/raw/017.wav"
  },
  "018": {
    "text": "画面里的红色字母，是固定生成的教学错误样本，不冒充真实实验数据。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.58,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 512,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "b8e7e8e3c186b135c76f0073c62b572afc6f999da9e8b69ff05edc17283abfdd",
    "seconds": 5.92,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/public/audio/raw/018.wav"
  },
  "019": {
    "text": "先让地址把读段送回各自的桶，再看每个桶里哪些位置互相支持。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.58,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 512,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "b147acc14db472d32fdc56efab3e137c86bcf1376f29e0f9caf2b0c19bfebd0a",
    "seconds": 5.52,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/public/audio/raw/019.wav"
  },
  "020": {
    "text": "同一位置的多条读段，需要先做局部比对；动态规划矩阵只展示这一小块关系。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.58,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 512,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "b7bfd1f74016362a3b163b2b3fa7c8939dc34d34f59aa3590ecb969d512a5d6e",
    "seconds": 6.8,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/public/audio/raw/020.wav"
  },
  "021": {
    "text": "对齐以后，按测序质量给每个字母加权，逐列取共识。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.58,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 512,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "c6642969676c7763df5c7d576d239fe9c0c2afcf3f959aa2de7b6f0588ca4836",
    "seconds": 4.72,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/public/audio/raw/021.wav"
  },
  "022": {
    "text": "外层纠错再补回缺口：编码负责提前留余地，比对和共识负责从噪声里找证据。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.58,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 512,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "517d83f54d52da5b2e03745d469ec6e8125f149ddeff72516315a7da08ceaa65",
    "seconds": 7.12,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/public/audio/raw/022.wav"
  },
  "023": {
    "text": "这两层经常被混在一起，其实一个在写入前，一个在读回后。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.58,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 512,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "cbdcc9d73a8418fa501acd16ca9a9a82de62fa4938524eb67bad1428f013157a",
    "seconds": 4.8,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/public/audio/raw/023.wav"
  },
  "024": {
    "text": "生信算法的价值，就是把杂乱的短读段变成可核对的文件。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.58,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 512,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "3c74310cb2a27fd799bcf8473c7210c7fde33f23e91d510193d6e69deb89246d",
    "seconds": 5.44,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/public/audio/raw/024.wav"
  },
  "025": {
    "text": "那大模型能做什么？它先把 DNA 看成一串 token，而不是一句自然语言。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.58,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 512,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "803ae7a7b78e198b1c747b9765a87e25ae37a8ca403bbaf9a99e99bcebb4878b",
    "seconds": 6.08,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/public/audio/raw/025.wav"
  },
  "026": {
    "text": "固定 k-mer片段 像每隔几格切一刀；DNABERT-2 用 BPE分词，把常见片段合成更长的 token。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.58,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 512,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "requestHash": "96a3d45cde5ee2cab3117600136f524bc90b79eba6d36306974cb27c3f4b8e24",
    "seconds": 10.08,
    "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/public/audio/raw/026.wav"
  },
  "027": {
    "text": "模型可以给候选序列打分，提示哪一段更可能在这次实验里出错。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
